      "id": "2119936747740315770",
      "text": "Kenrich Williams worked alongside volunteers with the Homeless Alliance Day Shelter in OKC to serve lunch to approximately 250 of the agency’s clientele on Monday. Chet Holmgren hosted his 5th annual Thanksgiving dinner at a local steakhouse for foster families supported by https://t.co/rOihSuP06E",
