      "id": "2119895492905587195",
      "text": "Nique Clifford will wear #18 in OKC. He wore #10 with the Kings this season. But the Seattle SuperSonics retired #10 for Nate McMillan. OKC has their history until NBA expansion brings the Sonics back. Clifford wore #5 his rookie season... last worn in OKC by Lu Dort.",
